    "icon": "fa-solid",
    "title": "जगदम्बा श्री पुरस्कार २०८२ ",
    "desc": "मदन पुरस्कार स्थापना गर्ने रानी जगदम्बा देवीको स्मृतिमा दिन थालिएको ",
    "content": "\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-4\">\n  <table class=\"w-full text-sm text-left border-collapse border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 my-4\">\n    <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 font-bold\">\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">Header 1</th>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">Header 2</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">२०८२ को बिजेता </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">किरण खरेल </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">२०८१ को बिजेता </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">प्रेमदेव गिरि </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">२०८० को बिजेता </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">प्रा. डा. योगेन्द्रप्रसाद यादव </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">स्थापना </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">बि.सं. २०४५ साल </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">पुरस्कार राशी </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">रु. ४ लाख </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">पहिलो जगदम्बा पुरस्कार विजेता </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">नारायण गोपाल गुरुवाचार्य </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n",
    "pdf": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "1790306758808",
    "code": "4.",
    "icon": "fa-solid",
    "title": "नेपाल एकीकरण सम्बन्धि मितिहरू ",
    "desc": "Dates related to Prithivi Narayan Shah during Unification of Nepal.",
    "content": "\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-4\">\n  <table class=\"w-full text-sm text-left border-collapse border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 my-4\">\n    <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 font-bold\">\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">ठाउँ</th>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">युद्ध/विजय मिति </th>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">नेतृत्व गर्ने </th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">नुवाकोट </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८०१ असोज १५ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">कालु पाण्डे </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">नगरकोट </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८०३</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">जहागिर शाह </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">नालादुम </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८०३ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">कालु पाण्डे </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">लामीडाँडा </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८०४ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">-</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">दहचोक </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८१२ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">-</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">कृतिपुर पहिलो आक्रमण </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८१४ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">कालु पाण्डे / सुरप्रताप शाह </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">काभ्रे र पलान्चोक </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८१६ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">रामकृष्ण कुँवर </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">धुलिखेल </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८२० </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">दलवीर शाह र रामकृष्ण कुँवर </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">हरिहरपुर </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८१९ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">सुरप्रताप शाह </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">मकवानपुर बिजय </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८१९ भाद्र ९ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">वंशराज पाण्डे र केशरसिंह बस्नेत </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">कीर्तिपुर दोश्रो आक्रमण  </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८२१ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">सुरप्रताप शाह </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">कीर्तिपुर बिजय </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८२२ भाद्र ३ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">बंशराज पाण्डे र सुरप्रताप शाह </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">किनलक संग युद्ध </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८२४ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\"></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">कान्तिपुर विजय </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८२५ असोज १३ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">पृथ्वीनारायण शाह, तुलाराम पाण्डे र रामकृष्ण कुँवर </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">पाटन बिजय </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८२५ असोज २४ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\"> तुलाराम पाण्डे र रामकृष्ण कुँवर </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">भादगाउँ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८२६ मङ्सिर १ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">बंशराज पाण्डे र सुरप्रताप शाह </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">भिरकोट </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८२८ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">बंशराज पाण्डे र सुरप्रताप शाह </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">चौदण्डी </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८२९ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">-</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">इलाम </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८३१ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">रामकृष्ण कुँवर र दलजित शाह </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">विजयपुर </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८३१ साउन ५ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">-</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">लमजुङ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८३९ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">जिबशाह र दामोदर पाण्डे </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">कास्की </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८४२ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">जिबशाह र दामोदर पाण्डे </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">पर्बत </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८४३ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">दामोदर पाण्डे </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">गुल्मी </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८४३ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">काजी बम पाण्डे </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">जुम्ला </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८४३ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">शिवनारायण खत्री </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">डोटी </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८४७ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">काजी जगजित पाण्डे </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">पाल्पा </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१८३१ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">काजी अमरसिह थापा र दलमर्दन पाण्डे </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\"></td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\"></td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\"></td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n",
    "pdf": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "1790310675397",
    "code": "4.",
    "icon": "fa-solid",
    "title": "यातायात ",
    "desc": "यातायात सम्बन्धि ",
    "content": "\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-4\">\n  <table class=\"w-full text-sm text-left border-collapse my-4\">\n    <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 font-bold\">\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">Header 1</th>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">Header 2</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">नेपालमा बग्गी चढ्ने पहिलो व्यक्ति:</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">भिमसेन थापा </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">नेपालमा मोटर चढ्ने पहिलो व्यक्ति :</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">वीर शमशेर ज.ब.रा. ( वि.सं. १९५०)</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<u><b>राष्ट्रिय गौरवका सडक आयोजनाहरु:</b></u>\n\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-4\">\n  <table class=\"w-full text-sm text-left border-collapse my-4\">\n    <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 font-bold\">\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">नाम </th>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">दुरी </th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">पुष्पलाल लोकमार्ग </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">१८७९ किमी </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">हुलाकी राजमार्ग आयोजना </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">१८७५ कि.मी.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">उत्तर दक्षिण लोकमार्ग ( kaligandaki corridor )</td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">४४७ कि.मी.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">कर्णाली करिडोर </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">२६९ कि.मी.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">महाकाली लोकमार्ग </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">१६.८ कि.मी.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">कोशी करिडोर </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">१६२ कि.मी.</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">सेती लोकमार्ग </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800\">९.५ कि.मी.</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<u><b><b>नेपालका </b>१५ राष्ट्रिय राजमार्गहरूको विवरण :</b></u>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto my-4\">\n  <table class=\"w-full text-sm text-left border-collapse border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 my-4\">\n    <thead class=\"bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 font-bold\">\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">कोड नं.</th>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">राजमार्ग </th>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">जोड्ने स्थान </th>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">दुरी </th>\n        <th class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">सहयोग </th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">H01 </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">महेन्द्र राजमार्ग </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">पूर्व-पश्चिम </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१०२८ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">भारत, रुस, बेलायत, ADB </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">H02 </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">त्रिभुवन राजमार्ग </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">सिसिर्या -त्रिपुरेश्वर </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१५५ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">भारत </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">H03 </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">अरनिको राजमार्ग </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">माइतीघर- मितेरीसाँघु </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">११२.८३ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">चीन  </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">H04 </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">पृथ्वी राजमार्ग </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">नौबीसे- पोखरा </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">१७३ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">चीन</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">H05 </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">मदन-आश्रित मार्ग </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">नारायणगढ- मुग्लिन </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700\">३६.१६ </td>\n        <td class=\"p-2.5 border 